1
00:00:00,108 --> 00:00:03,148
(Raj:)Let's hear all
the "Raj is a girl" jokes.

2
00:00:03,311 --> 00:00:06,121
(Howard:)Nope, Bernadette told me
it isn't nice and I'm not allowed.

3
00:00:06,281 --> 00:00:08,421
(Raj:)-Thank you.
-So I won't be making fun of you,

4
00:00:08,583 --> 00:00:11,933
