Come on, look at what I'm making.

6
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,500
(Howard:)Oh, that's actually pretty nice.

7
00:00:21,663 --> 00:00:24,403
(Amy:)-I'm making a bracelet.
-Yeah, I'm just making a mess.

8
00:00:26,935 --> 00:00:29,345
(Howard:)You know, instead of beads and glue,

9
00:00:29,504 --> 00:00:30,844
(Howard:)you guys can use my soldering iron.

10
00:00:31,005 --> 00:00:32,845
(Howard:)You'd be able to make
much cooler stuff.

11
00:00:33,007 --> 00:00:36,177
(Raj:)Oh, I think we're doing
just fine, thank you.

12
00:00:36,344 --> 00:00:38,754
(Amy:)Actually, I'd kind of like
to try that.

13
00:00:38,913 --> 00:00:40,293
(Bernadette:)-Me, too.
-Be right back.

14
00:00:41,482 --> 00:00:43,862
(Penny:)When did I have pistachios?

15
00:00:49,657 --> 00:00:53,867
(Sheldon:)Arthur.

16
00:00:55,763 --> 00:00:57,543
(Sheldon:)Door knocker.

